From: RG35XX Java Platform
Task: RGJ-RC1-011CA
Subject: [PATCH] graphics: bypass GNU Classpath glyph rasterizer on RG35XX

Device evidence shows MIDP font metrics are usable, while GNU Classpath
Graphics2D.drawString reaches AbstractGraphics2D.renderScanline and throws NPE.
Keep all existing MIDP metric/anchor calculations and desktop Java2D behavior,
but route RG35XX glyph pixels directly into PlatformGraphics.canvasData.

--- a/src/org/recompile/mobile/PlatformGraphics.java
+++ b/src/org/recompile/mobile/PlatformGraphics.java
@@ -853,7 +853,20 @@
 			if((anchor & Graphics.BOTTOM)>0) { y = y-height; }
 			if((anchor & Graphics.BASELINE)>0) { y = y-ascent; }
 
-			gc.drawString(str, x, y);
+			if(RG35XXPlatformProfile.isActive() && !Mobile.isDoJa)
+			{
+				final int clipLeft = Math.max(0, getClipX() + translateX);
+				final int clipTop = Math.max(0, getClipY() + translateY);
+				final int clipRight = Math.min(canvasWidth, getClipX() + translateX + getClipWidth());
+				final int clipBottom = Math.min(canvasHeight, getClipY() + translateY + getClipHeight());
+				RG35XXBitmapText.draw(canvasData, canvasWidth, canvasHeight,
+					str, x + translateX, y + translateY, ascent, height,
+					font, getColor(), clipLeft, clipTop, clipRight, clipBottom);
+			}
+			else
+			{
+				gc.drawString(str, x, y);
+			}
 		}
 	}
 
